  "content": {
    "homeTitle": "ROLL TOGETHER. PLAY TO WIN.",
    "homeDescription": "Three squads, one scoreboard, and a lot of pride. Team Classic Rollers is where Cambodian bowlers train hard, compete together and get better every frame.",
    "aboutTitle": "Built for the love of the game",
    "aboutDescription": "We're a Cambodian bowling team that treats every frame as a chance to get better, and every teammate as family.",
    "aboutHeading": "More than a bowling team",
    "aboutBody": "Team Classic Rollers brings Cambodian bowlers together to train, compete and improve. You'll find us working on spares, learning from each other and cheering just as loudly for a teammate's first strike as for a tournament win.",
    "aboutBody2": "We care about discipline, respect, teamwork and steady progress. Whether you're chasing your next tournament or still learning to read a scoresheet, there's a place for you here and people ready to help you grow."
  },
